---

<section id="testimonios" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#F9F9F9] relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-[#E7EAE8]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Assistantly Style) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#10201C] tracking-tight mb-4">
        La tranquilidad de recuperar tu <br class="hidden sm:inline"/>
        <span class="text-[#183A33] underline decoration-[#C6E79E] decoration-4 underline-offset-4">
          libertad crediticia
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#333333]/80 leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Miles de colombianos y familias ya superaron sus reportes y deudas con el acompañamiento jurídico legal y transparente de <strong>Sin Huellas</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Spotlight Cards Grid: Real Images with Motion & Assistantly Aesthetics -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Smiling Relieved Woman (Client Victory with Zoom Scroll & Hover Zoom) -->
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#E7EAE8] overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#183A33]/50 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 ease-out flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
        <div class="scroll-zoom-box relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] bg-[#183A33]/5">
          <img 
            src="/client-victory.jpg" 
            alt="Celular con la certificación de Sin Huellas y paz y salvo legal" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          
          <!-- Top Floating Tag (Sin mención de ciudad, alcance nacional) -->
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-10">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#E6F3D4] text-[#183A33] shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
              ✓ Caso Ganado
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card Content Details -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between flex-grow">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <div class="flex text-[#183A33] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#183A33]/70">· Caso Verificado en Datacrédito</span>
            </div>
            <blockquote class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#10201C] font-normal leading-relaxed italic mb-4">
              "Tenía 3 reportes que llevaban más de 4 años bloqueando mis solicitudes de crédito de vivienda. Los abogados de Sin Huellas radicaron el derecho de petición bajo la Ley 2157 y en 21 días me entregaron mi certificación de retiro total de la central de riesgo."
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E7EAE8] flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-[#10201C]">Valeria Salazar R.</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#333333]/70">Arquitecta Independiente · Cliente de Sin Huellas</span>
            </div>
            <span class="num-assist text-xs font-bold text-[#183A33] bg-[#E6F3D4] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
              Ley 2157
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Legal Handshake & Absolute Trust (with Zoom Scroll & Hover Zoom) -->
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#E7EAE8] overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#183A33]/50 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 ease-out flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm cursor-pointer" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
        <div class="scroll-zoom-box relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] bg-[#183A33]/5">
          <img 
            src="/trust-handshake.jpg" 
            alt="Acuerdo legal y apretón de manos de confianza mutua en la firma Sin Huellas" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <!-- Gradient overlay -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#10201C]/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>

          <!-- Top Floating Tag -->
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-10">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#183A33] text-[#C6E79E] shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
              ✦ Alianza & Respaldo Jurídico
